{"id":"wb-7-1496","name":"伊宁陕西大寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"伊宁陕西大寺","text":"伊宁陕西大寺，又称陕甘大寺、陕西大寺、伊宁陕西清真大寺、伊宁回族大寺、伊宁陕西回族大寺、伊犁回族大寺、宁固寺、凤凰寺等，是清代伊犁九城中最大的清真寺，也是伊犁最早建成的一批清真寺之一，全国重点文物保护单位。位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州伊宁市。伊宁陕西大寺是中国传统建筑，兼有伊斯兰建筑风格，由宣礼塔、礼拜殿等建筑构成。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E5%AE%81%E9%99%95%E8%A5%BF%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93442655,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93442655","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ecb26c3472f9a0f044f32122.jpg","title":"伊宁陕西大寺（胜利路方向的门）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BC%8A%E5%AE%81%E9%99%95%E8%A5%BF%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%BA%EF%BC%88%E8%83%9C%E5%88%A9%E8%B7%AF%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E9%97%A8%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/%E4%BC%8A%E5%AE%81%E9%99%95%E8%A5%BF%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%BA%EF%BC%88%E8%83%9C%E5%88%A9%E8%B7%AF%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E9%97%A8%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​伊宁陕西大寺（胜利路方向的门）","width":320,"height":427}}